      "reason": "WorkPage composes one read-only client Work projection: independently current Strategy list/detail views and Workspace document projection. This bounded change supplies one current member-directory read through the existing shared operation and presents its owner labels across those projections. The exact Clerk-subject resolution/fallback policy has one pure owner in owners.ts; transport/schema/current-read cancellation and authority replacement remain shared owners. Workspace document filtering/table, source failures and Strategy adapters retain their separate owners. JSX growth adds identity context to the same Work view, not a second writer, authorization system or domain lifecycle. Splitting presentation solely at 80 lines would obscure the intentionally shared current-directory snapshot without removing responsibility overlap. Supplied individual upcoming-node status is rendered alongside ownership using the existing display conversion; no new state or status policy is added."
